1113.1 Purpose and Creation
The Garnet & Gold Voting Commission shall be an affiliated project of the
Student Government Association that shall occur every other year, aligning with
any school year that is an election year. The Garnet & Gold Voting Commission
shall engage key stakeholders to strategically increase civic engagement and
voter turnout among the FSU Student Body for each election year through
programming, education, and action.
